      "id": "Stechsoft.Encryption.AES",
      "range": "[1.0.0, )"
    },
    "message": "To enhance security by using a unique encryption key for each project, modify the implementation so that:\n\n1. Each project generates its unique encryption key and IV.\n2. Keys are stored securely in a file (encryption_keys.json) within the client application directory.\n3. No hardcoded keys exist in the SDK.\n4. Unique Keys Per Project: The encryption key is stored in the client app directory, ensuring that each SDK application has its unique key.\n5. Secure Key Storage: The SDK does not hardcode any encryption keys, reducing the risk of leaks.\n6. Automatic Key Generation: A new key is generated automatically if no key file is found.\n7. Error Handling for Corrupt Files: Ensures the key file is valid before using it.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy",
      "CriticalBugs"
    ]
  },
